      "required_fix": "Fresh narrow RunnerV4 must update this affirmative freezer equality to the exact current freezer producer and preserve the Task/work and actual manifest linkage. Its newly changed Binder/preparation/review must then be explicitly retargeted in the dependent new MigrationOuter; do not mutate existing V3/OuterV1 or transfer their previous no-findings result."
